# ability still triggers (CR 603.6c) and deals 2 damage to Bot2. The three Moxen come back to Bot1's hand; Munitions does not
# (hand 4 = 1 spare Mountain + 3 Moxen), and the battlefield holds only Weapons Manufacturing and the Mountain.

